Package: geopytorch
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to 'GeoPyTorch'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Daniel",
    family = "Tinoco",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "dbtnc.ps2@gmail.com"
  )
Description: Spatial models built on 'GPyTorch' and 'PyTorch'.
    Covariance parameters can be fixed or estimated
    by maximum likelihood or restricted maximum likelihood, and predictions
    include their variances. 'Python' and the required packages are installed
    on first use by 'reticulate'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dbtnc/geopytorch
BugReports: https://github.com/dbtnc/geopytorch/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.41.0),
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.12)
